   1: /**
   2:  * crd.4a — the at-Court City Status advantage gate on PUT /:id/resolve
   3:  * (Epic CRD, specs/stories/crd-4a-defensive-status-choice.md).
   4:  *
   5:  *   AC1 — the three-condition gate (power_name set, game mode active via
   6:  *         currentCycleInGamePhase, both sides attended:true in the current
   7:  *         game session) plus the City-Status-higher requirement, computed
   8:  *         fresh from live data on every call. Each condition tested failing
   9:  *         alone.
  10:  *   AC2 — when the gate is open, the response carries status_choice
  11:  *         { eligible: true, bp_value, city_value } even before a term is
  12:  *         chosen. Omitted when the gate is closed.
