codex
Pass 2 found a more serious cross-layer race than the client-only trace suggests: the generation guard prevents stale painting, but both requests still mutate Mongo, so an older `/resolve` can overwrite the newer choice after its response has been ignored. I’m freezing that and the remaining repository-context findings now; I will not open the story spec in this turn.
